                                "sense_id": "890f8af6-fc3e-3e76-a90a-330adde77b70",
                                "text": "Il est également important d'apporter un éclairage sur l'emploi des termes dans la francophonie tout en privilégiant ceux déjà en usage au Québec, mais en s'assurant qu'ils sont conformes au système morphosémantique du français.",
                                "translation": "It is just as important to shed light on the use of the terms in the Francophonie while favouring those that are already in use in Quebec, but ensuring that they are consistent with the morphosemantic system of the French language.",
                                "english": "It is just as important to shed light on the use of the terms in the Francophonie while favouring those that are already in use in Quebec, but ensuring that they are consistent with the morphosemantic system of the French language."
                            }
                        ]
